    <title>Vol.9 秋冬的寒意袭来，你体内的爱意被唤醒了吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65410f835250ea2baa62f5e8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65410f835250ea2baa62f5e8</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 31 Oct 2023 14:30:26 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>国内的秋冬就要来了。可能部分朋友们已经正式入秋了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>对我来说，秋冬一直是值得期待的季节，仿佛很多好事、幸运的事都会发生。</span></p><span></span><p><span>明亮的灯光、温暖的壁炉、宽阔的怀抱......我想或许许多人还会期待着命运般的爱情在这个季节降临。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期节目，我想与你分享我们身体对秋冬温度的感知变化。你知道吗？爱情也在我们身上发生着相似的反应。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期适合睡前聆听，希望你拥有美好的夜晚，也拥有美好的秋冬，满怀希望🌙</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkcW0awHN33pk9rH1toGRqfuTN2G.jpeg"></figure><span></span><h2><strong><span>【收听指引】</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">01:10</a> 秋冬于我的感知</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="309">05:09</a> 爱情的三个维度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="653">10:53</a> 大脑的不同部分控制的情感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="791">13:11</a> 浪漫爱情中的“吊桥效应”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1117">18:37</a> 浪漫爱情是盲目的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1306">21:46</a> 亲密陪伴在秋冬弥足珍贵</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>【本期BGM】</span></strong></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>sleepmakeswaves - 《It's Dark, It's Cold, It's Winter》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>HYUKOH - 《Gondry》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h1><strong><span>【制作人员】</span></strong></h1><span></span><p><span>策划&amp;制作｜梓楠</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面设计｜Ray</span></p><span></span><h1><strong><span>【本期资料库】</span></strong></h1><span></span><p><span>📚</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>罗兰·米勒《亲密关系》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>珍妮特·温特森 《写在身体上》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🎬</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>《太阳的后裔》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《鬼怪》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《老友记》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《举重妖精》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>【相关往期】</span></h2><span></span><p>